  "title": "GMU8_LEUVEN - representative subset for camtrapReport examples and tests",
  "description": "A compact, relationship-preserving subset of the GMU8_LEUVEN Camtrap DP dataset prepared for camtrapReport examples and automated software tests. The subset contains eight physical camera sites and all deployments at those sites whose deployments started from 2018 through 2023. All linked observations are retained. Image-level media metadata is thinned to the first and last media record of each sequence, plus every media record explicitly referenced by an observation. The subset is intended for software demonstration and validation, not ecological inference.",
